  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY: {自動詞|じどうし} (intransitive). Transitive pair: {解|と}く (to untie, solve).\n\nASPECT: ている indicates state. {解|と}けている = 'is undone/solved.'\n\nHOMOPHONES:\n- {解|と}ける - to come undone, be solved\n- {溶|と}ける - to melt, dissolve\n- {融|と}ける - to melt (metals, ice)\n\nCOMMON PATTERNS:\n- {紐|ひも}が{解|と}ける (a string comes undone)\n- {問題|もんだい}が{解|と}ける (a problem is solved)\n- {誤解|ごかい}が{解|と}ける (misunderstanding is cleared)\n- {緊張|きんちょう}が{解|と}ける (tension is released)\n\nTRANSITIVE PAIR:\n- {解|と}ける (intransitive) - to come undone\n- {解|と}く (transitive) - to untie, solve",
